    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granny Tita has saved a healthy supply of colorful local fruit to hurl at enemies. The gigantes are trying to invade the town, but you\u2019re not scared. Dunk on a few pesky foes, joyfully platform around, and take a bite or two of that fruit yourself. You can even nap afterwards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.poster.avif?t=1749993210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.webm?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.mp4?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Teeko and Tita in a heartfelt, dialogue-driven adventure inspired by Costa Rica\u2019s D\u00eda de las Mascaradas and discover the truth behind the corrupted gigantes. It\u2019s dinner time soon, and the Casados are smelling like never before - but it\u2019s just not the same without the whole family around. <br><br>Explore seven different worlds, face off against seven different bosses, and use all seven(?) of your Sloth senses to bounce and dunk around in the gorgeous locals of Costa Rica.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.poster.avif?t=1749993210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.webm?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.mp4?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/0970e236b51aa538a680e1cc161891f1.avif?t=1749993210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/81e8b83d2e536c8ba3032ebd5317d853.avif?t=1749993210\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy snacking!</i> <br>- Teeko</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granny Tita has saved a healthy supply of colorful local fruit to hurl at enemies. The gigantes are trying to invade the town, but you\u2019re not scared. Dunk on a few pesky foes, joyfully platform around, and take a bite or two of that fruit yourself. You can even nap afterwards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.poster.avif?t=1749993210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.webm?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/59ca54a47c5aad7b2111c5fd6790d2cd.mp4?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Teeko and Tita in a heartfelt, dialogue-driven adventure inspired by Costa Rica\u2019s D\u00eda de las Mascaradas and discover the truth behind the corrupted gigantes. It\u2019s dinner time soon, and the Casados are smelling like never before - but it\u2019s just not the same without the whole family around. <br><br>Explore seven different worlds, face off against seven different bosses, and use all seven(?) of your Sloth senses to bounce and dunk around in the gorgeous locals of Costa Rica.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.poster.avif?t=1749993210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.webm?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/58ce50b49c26006d19d4f5295e31aa04.mp4?t=1749993210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/0970e236b51aa538a680e1cc161891f1.avif?t=1749993210\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/81e8b83d2e536c8ba3032ebd5317d853.avif?t=1749993210\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Happy snacking!</i> <br>- Teeko</p>",
    "short_description": "Platformer meets tower defense in this story-rich game inspired by the Costa Rican D\u00eda de Las Mascaradas festival. One day, grandma Tita's kids get possessed by the spirits of the gigantes and begin to wreak havoc upon the land. It's now up to her pet sloth, Teeko, to save their town.",
